        "original_id": "977aca5a-07e2-5159-a599-2b21b7129067",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tanya Donelly, Trace Cyrus, Kim Deal, Kristin Hersh\n- Bands: The Breeders, Throwing Muses, Pixies\n- Albums: Limbo\n- Companies: Rykodisc\n- Places: Newport, Rhode Island, New England\n- Topics: American alternative rock, singer-songwriters, musicians\n\nFacts:\n- Tanya Donelly was born on July 14, 1966, in Newport, Rhode Island.\n- Tanya Donelly is an American Grammy Award-nominated singer-songwriter and guitarist based in New England.\n- Tanya Donelly co-founded Throwing Muses with her stepsister Kristin Hersh.\n- Trace Cyrus was born as Neil Timothy Helson on February 24, 1989.\n- Trace Cyrus is an American musician.\n- The Breeders are an American alternative rock band formed in 1989 by Kim Deal of the Pixies and Tanya Donelly of Throwing Muses.\n- Limbo is a 1996 album by the American alternative rock band Throwing Muses.\n- Throwing Muses released Limbo on Rykodisc.",
